  "Gravitational waves could reveal hidden alien worlds.",
  "The upcoming LISA mission will detect ripples in space-time caused by orbiting masses.",
  "These ripples can betray the presence of exoplanets orbiting double white dwarf systems.",
  "A planet’s gravity creates a wobble, leaving a unique sideband signature in the signal.",
  "NASA’s Webb telescope can then confirm these findings using infrared light.",
  "This method unveils an entirely new population of planets across our galaxy."
